  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak.\n• Cut potato into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place potato, Mumbai spice blend and brown mustard seeds on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, toss to coat and spread out evenly.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a01ac79e3e3f584728987e-52f37765.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice cucumber into rounds.\n• Grate carrot (see ingredients).\n• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a01ac79e3e3f584728987e-909f75ad.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When potato has 5 minutes remaining, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Remove pan from heat, then add sweet chilli sauce, turning haloumi to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a01ac79e3e3f584728987e-be42cade.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine mixed salad leaves, cucumber, carrot and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season with salt and pepper.\n• Divide sweet chilli haloumi, Bombay potatoes and cucumber salad between plates.\n• Sprinkle over crushed peanuts and serve with garlic aioli. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a01ac79e3e3f584728987e-8596ba08.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
